Licenses of @graupel/model-data
===============================

The files of this package are under two licenses. Each data file names its
license in the header field meta.license; REUSE.toml lists the same
assignment in machine-readable form. The full license texts are in
LICENSES/.

Data derived from Open-Meteo.com: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC-BY-4.0, LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt)

  model_catalogue.json
  model_domains.json
  chain_zones.json
  chain_zones.geojson

  Contains data derived from Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0,
  https://open-meteo.com/). Modified: selected, combined and processed by
  graupel-gen; see meta.sources of each file.

  When you use or redistribute these files, keep this attribution, the
  license notice and the note that the data was modified.

Own data without Open-Meteo content: Mozilla Public License 2.0
(MPL-2.0, LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt)

  quantities.json
  regions.geojson      (country borders from Natural Earth, public domain,
                        combined with own curation)
  resolver_cases.json
  package.json, README.md, THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md

